#. ~ Description of "simple patchwork scarf (headwrap)"
#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
msgid ""
"A simple and light cloth scarf, worn over the head and mouth for warmth.  Use"
" it to wear it around your head."
msgstr ""
"Prosty i lekki szal materiałowy, noszony na głowie i ustach dla ochrony przed"
" zimnem. Użyj go, by nosić go wokół głowy."

